Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.46,0:00:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs65\shad0\bord0\c&H6356AC&\pos(960,637.2)}爪爪字幕組
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.38,0:02:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,有動靜嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.55,0:02:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有人進出
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.37,0:02:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,看出來了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.38,0:02:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,被法拉第說中了 他換地方了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.43,0:02:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,確實是我們搞砸了 但事情已經發生了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.32,0:02:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,荒坂如此警戒 一定是大事了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.78,0:02:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,惱火的是法拉第不肯開口
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.31,0:02:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,看來好戲在後頭了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.82,0:02:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,想放長線釣大魚 卻總是求而不得嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.61,0:02:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,要我繼續調查田中嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.57,0:02:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想打聽荒坂公司的情報
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.03,0:02:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那是中間人的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.70,0:02:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,「我發號施令 你服從辦事 這就是規則」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.83,0:02:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 不過 琦薇已經行動了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.96,0:02:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,就看我們能挖到什麼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.80,0:02:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,所以現在暫時閒著
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.48,0:03:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不如找點樂子 消磨時間
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.68,0:03:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord0\fs45\c&H391FEE&\pos(780.8,606.8)}大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.15,0:03:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛 我現在很忙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.28,0:03:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,沒什麼 只是你沒聯絡我…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.16,0:03:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你說了 有工作會聯繫你的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.54,0:03:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,現在沒工作嗎 我什麼都願意做
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.08,0:03:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不要急 你上次的錢已經花光了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.38,0:03:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不只是錢的問題
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.35,0:03:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.45,0:03:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要多學點工作的事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.69,0:03:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不能總依賴別人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.71,0:03:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.55,0:03:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好 知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.35,0:03:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是阿多
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.26,0:03:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼 誰在問
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.73,0:03:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,曼恩叫我來的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.70,0:03:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼 你就是戴維斯嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.36,0:03:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.90,0:03:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.86,0:03:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.24,0:03:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,戴維斯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.15,0:04:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫大衛 不是戴維斯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.37,0:04:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,別衝我吼 我聽得見
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.53,0:04:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛 你是皮拉的小弟
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.62,0:04:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,皮拉的小弟
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.50,0:04:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,就是你吧 把荒坂的豪車撞爛的小子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.77,0:04:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.90,0:04:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,是我第一次出來工作
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.30,0:04:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那輛轎車至少值五千歐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.73,0:04:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你當時沒撞得稀巴爛的話
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.77,0:04:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我下次就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.20,0:04:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.68,0:04:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我下次會做得更好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.73,0:04:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你說下次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.77,0:04:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你和荒坂就像屎和糞坑
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.16,0:04:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.45,0:04:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,就是說…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.58,0:04:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不是很明顯嗎 一個是屎 另一個裝滿屎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.29,0:04:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,聽說沃森區的賽博瘋子了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.62,0:04:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,最近不停出現
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.37,0:04:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 殺了兩個巡警
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.07,0:04:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我看了帶子 真是血腥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.92,0:04:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,單憑一個發射器就把人變成漿糊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.29,0:05:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是大衛 近來可好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.35,0:05:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.52,0:05:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了 需要幫忙嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.77,0:05:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,這是曼恩要給皮拉的包裹
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.03,0:05:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.98,0:05:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,哥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.40,0:05:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,哥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.95,0:05:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,曼恩的包裹
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.58,0:05:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,終於到啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.24,0:05:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道有多少人爭搶著想得到這隻義手嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.87,0:05:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,太炫啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.71,0:05:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你不用回家嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.50,0:05:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他還有別的指示留給我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.46,0:05:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,哥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.72,0:05:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,回去吧 給他小費
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.85,0:05:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己給 窮光蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.10,0:05:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,這還防彈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.38,0:05:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,今天這樣就算下班了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.77,0:05:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,看來是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.02,0:05:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.86,0:06:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 小費給這麼多嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.78,0:06:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你真可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.65,0:06:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,待會見 大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.66,0:06:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord2\c&HF9FF8A&\3c&H000000&\pos(1235.2,122)\frx2\fry342\frz1.919}{\fad(120,0)\shad0\fs45\c&HA2A762&}露西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.62,0:06:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你今晚有空嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.48,0:06:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你來了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.88,0:06:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是你叫我來的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.76,0:06:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是曼恩嘮嘮叨叨讓我來的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.55,0:06:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼 曼恩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.47,0:06:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼是我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.06,0:06:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,收養流浪貓的人就該負責到底 對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.31,0:06:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,但是決定留下他的人可是你 曼恩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.44,0:06:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,總之他一直磨我給他工作
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.03,0:06:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,看是要訓練還做什麼 讓他閉嘴就是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.28,0:06:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.16,0:06:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,真殘酷
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.24,0:06:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我是被捲進來淌這趟渾水的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.14,0:06:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,這倒是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.54,0:06:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不過說真的 你看起來並不像當賽博龐克的料
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.42,0:07:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你這身板 好像再裝一兩個植入體 就會瘋掉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.38,0:07:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒那麼弱不禁風
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.28,0:07:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,試試看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.14,0:07:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,用過嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.28,0:07:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.51,0:07:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,葛洛莉亞沒讓你試試
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.11,0:07:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,早點接觸比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.76,0:07:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,由我來教你也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.90,0:07:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我有斯安威斯坦 所以沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.19,0:07:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.09,0:07:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.51,0:07:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,露西 你是網路駭客嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.22,0:07:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 怎麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.56,0:07:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,沒什麼 網路駭客也需要跑步嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.89,0:08:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,網路駭客也是賽博龐克 沒什麼不同 都要訓練
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.66,0:08:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,槍就是護身符 家裡的老祖母身上帶的那種
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.20,0:08:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,想當賽博龐克 槍可要像保險套一樣隨時攜帶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.48,0:08:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,當然 也有些駭客在戰鬥中主要依靠自己的技術
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.27,0:08:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,但你目前還是先適應好自己的義體
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.61,0:08:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,考慮安裝其他植入體還太早了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.99,0:08:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,在那之前 槍是最容易獲取且簡單好用的武器
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.67,0:09:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.83,0:09:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.14,0:09:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,露西 你幾歲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.49,0:09:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟露西最近怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.49,0:09:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.11,0:09:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,應該還不錯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.28,0:09:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我的意思是 你的技術和年齡不太成正比
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.08,0:09:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,技術和年齡完全無關
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.42,0:09:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,全靠才能和努力
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.38,0:09:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,會因為年齡而輕視能力的人 恐怕是個蠢貨吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.78,0:09:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,比如誰
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.06,0:09:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,某些長臂科技狂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.78,0:10:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,「還不錯」是什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.49,0:10:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你們還沒到那一步嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.66,0:10:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 我們在說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.22,0:10:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛 不論是當賽博龐克 還是一個男人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.00,0:10:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,總是這副新人模樣可不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.51,0:10:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我以為那天看到你們在聊天
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.35,0:10:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,豪車搶劫慶功派對那會兒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.39,0:10:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他喜歡裝作是我的前輩 煩死了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.19,0:10:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,還總是毛手毛腳的 所以我電擊了他 叫他滾
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.47,0:10:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.53,0:10:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.40,0:10:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你是認真想成為賽博龐克嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.95,0:11:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我對她沒有那個意思
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.17,0:11:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你的心思不能更明顯了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.38,0:11:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,她對我沒那個意思
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.09,0:11:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.48,0:11:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼問這個
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.75,0:11:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,老實說 你不像這個類型的人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.98,0:11:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,哪裡不像
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.69,0:11:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,告訴我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.58,0:11:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是不知道這裡有多少是真實的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.12,0:11:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.58,0:11:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,她說想去月球
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.88,0:11:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,月球
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.20,0:11:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,說那是她的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.14,0:12:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,看不出 你跑得還挺快
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.78,0:12:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,最好是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.66,0:12:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,真的 比我預期的快
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.79,0:12:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想從一直領先的人口中聽到這句
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.35,0:13:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,從沒聽過她這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.17,0:13:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,果然都是騙人的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.63,0:13:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,誰知道 自己問問她不就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.05,0:13:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,根據當時的情況 她的那些話應該是為了拖延時間
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.47,0:13:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,但我們用她的特別超夢 一起去了月球
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.26,0:13:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你倆還上月球約會
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.18,0:13:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,在夜之城 沒有比這更浪漫的了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.57,0:13:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,來 這是訓練法的帶子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.24,0:13:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,這只是最低標準的訓練
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.81,0:13:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,今天是我帶你練的最後一天
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.16,0:13:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,等你能跑得比我快的時候再…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.67,0:13:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,再怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.92,0:14:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\fs40\t(0,1600,\fs39)\fn方正细圆_GBK\move(577,76.4,583.4,84.4,0,1593)}義體肺片04
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.84,0:14:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\fs80\t(0,1680,\fs79)\move(1601.2,202.4,1588.4,210.4,0,1673)}{\bord0\frz337.4\move(1577.2,218.4,1577.2,218.4,0,0)}超值價
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.05,0:14:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\fs80\t(0,1470,\fs79)\move(606.2,789.8,612.6,785,0,1463)}{\bord0}軍用盈餘裝備半價
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.01,0:14:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\move(1194.6,933.8,1190.4,925.6,7,1503)}{\an5\fs80\t(0,1510,\fs79)}{\bord0}免運費
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.02,0:14:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,她跟你們多久了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.03,0:14:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,大約一年 琦薇帶她來的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.03,0:14:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,說她是原生的天才
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.91,0:14:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,在那之前呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.16,0:14:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道細節 想知道的話 就自己問她吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.12,0:14:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我關注的重點是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.83,0:14:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他們能不能跟我合作
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.84,0:14:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我想也是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.17,0:14:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.3\frz273\frx2\fry16\pos(564.8,438.8)}{\bord0\fs55\c&H000000&}葛洛莉亞馬丁內斯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.94,0:15:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.03,0:15:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.08,0:15:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,老天 好大聲
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.20,0:15:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,尿得又長
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.83,0:15:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,令人煩躁
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.79,0:15:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你是有什麼毛病 當街撒尿的白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.67,0:15:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,臭傢伙 聽到了沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.92,0:15:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不要理他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.30,0:15:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,混帳老哥
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.13,0:15:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋 還尿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.43,0:15:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我在跟你說話 你聽到了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.19,0:15:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,聽好了 這裡不能隨地大小便
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.81,0:15:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,知道嗎 這條人行道屬於我們…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.73,0:15:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什麼鬼義體 好像是很厲害的晶片
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.57,0:15:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我看你肯定天天都用…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.92,0:16:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.68,0:16:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,大…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.93,0:16:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,衛…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.44,0:16:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,快閃開
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.55,0:16:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底在幹什麼 大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.46,0:16:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,皮拉被幹掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.59,0:16:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,腦漿噴得我渾身都是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.80,0:16:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,給我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.85,0:16:52.01,Default,aaaaaaaa,0,0,0,,混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.09,0:16:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,誰都沒資格殺掉他
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.31,0:17:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,蠢蛋 你也會性命不保的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.31,0:17:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,放開我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.11,0:17:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.78,0:17:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡 偏在這個節骨眼…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.99,0:17:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,琦薇 重設麗貝卡的系統
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.44,0:17:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.17,0:17:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,露西呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.96,0:17:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.79,0:17:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.00,0:17:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,露西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.83,0:18:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.58,0:18:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.52,0:18:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你在流血
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.59,0:18:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我才是唯一有資格殺他的人…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.94,0:18:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,別碰我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.32,0:18:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你要治療嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.98,0:18:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.02,0:18:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉歐 帶露西去找義體醫生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.19,0:18:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我和琦薇等夜之城警局來人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.99,0:18:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,這亂糟糟的 得有人留下來解釋 省得日後麻煩
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.41,0:18:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你也聽見了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.69,0:18:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛 你跟他們去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.38,0:18:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.12,0:18:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,就說是我和琦薇殺的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.54,0:18:50.22,Default,qqqqqq,0,0,0,,他們會將此事列為賽博瘋子肇事事件
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.22,0:18:53.51,Default,qqqqqq,0,0,0,,我們這邊的皮拉也被幹掉了 很棘手
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.76,0:18:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.66,0:18:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,剛才你有能力開槍了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.82,0:18:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,別總像新人那樣思考了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.06,0:19:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,又是你們 我其實沒有醫療執照
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.39,0:19:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,沒關係 我也不是自願過來的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.52,0:19:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,這可真是 行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.67,0:19:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我自己可以
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.75,0:19:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛 剩下的就交給你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.15,0:19:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.28,0:19:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,曼恩說你可以用他的車
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.08,0:19:27.00,Default,aaaaaa,0,0,0,,露西
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.38,0:19:38.71,Default,aaaaaaaaaa,0,0,0,,到這裡就好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.71,0:19:39.40,Default,aaaaaaa,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.75,0:19:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,再見
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.85,0:19:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我們可以聊聊嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.16,0:19:51.02,Default,aaaaaaaa,0,0,0,,跟我來
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.66,0:19:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,雲太厚了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.99,0:20:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,上次你帶我看的那個月球超夢很美
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.94,0:20:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我玩得很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.66,0:20:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我也有話想找你聊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.56,0:20:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.66,0:20:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那天跟你說的話不是瞎編的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.51,0:20:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那真的是我第一次告訴別人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.72,0:20:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.23,0:20:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不想相信 你說的那一切都是謊言
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.39,0:20:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那如果我現在又在騙你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.27,0:20:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我不信
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.74,0:20:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.76,0:20:30.41,Default,aaaaaaaa,0,0,0,,因為我不想相信
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.22,0:20:32.02,Default,aaaaaaaa,0,0,0,,瘋子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.38,0:20:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你應該早點說的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.01,0:20:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.69,0:20:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.99,0:20:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你對我那麼生氣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.28,0:20:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒有生氣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.49,0:20:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.12,0:20:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒生氣 只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.69,0:20:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 也許有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.67,0:20:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,看 你還是承認了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.62,0:20:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我是生氣 但…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.12,0:20:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不會因此討厭你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.89,0:20:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我如果討厭你 就不會救你了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.16,0:20:57.61,Default,aaaaaaa,0,0,0,,騙人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.03,0:20:58.55,Default,aaaaaaa,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.63,0:20:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不 那不是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.13,0:21:01.68,Default,aaaaaaa,0,0,0,,你是那種
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.04,0:21:03.08,Default,aaaaaaa,0,0,0,,不論任何人遇險
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.36,0:21:04.51,Default,aaaaaaa,0,0,0,,都會不假思索
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.91,0:21:06.22,Default,aaaaaaa,0,0,0,,奮不顧身
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.19,0:21:08.52,Default,aaaaaaa,0,0,0,,躍入火坑去救人的類型
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.92,0:21:11.90,Default,aaaaaaa,0,0,0,,所以你覺得我做不到嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.48,0:21:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,曼恩覺得我行 可是你…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.36,0:21:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.98,0:21:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我覺得 你會成為傑出的賽博龐克
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.61,0:21:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,大概吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.66,0:21:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那問題是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.07,0:21:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,讓你聞名世界的 不會是當下風光的賽博龐克人生
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.00,0:21:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,而是你戰死的慘烈瞬間
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.03,0:21:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣的人生 不適合你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.13,0:21:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,但我和你並沒有那麼不同
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.34,0:21:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒有別的地方可去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.09,0:21:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我也沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.81,0:21:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我們是完全不同的人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.26,0:21:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不同在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.25,0:21:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我會帶你到月球去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.33,0:21:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我答應你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.76,0:22:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我不要你死
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.97,0:22:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我不會死的
Comment: 0,0:22:12.12,0:22:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.05,0:00:41.44,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}Eyes burning a way through me
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.63,0:00:47.79,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}Eyes destroying so sweetly
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.02,0:00:54.34,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}Now there is a fire in me
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.75,0:01:02.52,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}A fire that burns
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.85,0:01:31.58,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}This fire is out of control
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.58,0:01:32.38,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.38,0:01:33.23,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.23,0:01:34.05,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.05,0:01:35.44,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it down
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.71,0:01:45.51,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.51,0:01:46.36,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.36,0:01:47.18,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.18,0:01:48.57,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it down
Comment: 0,0:01:49.18,0:01:51.18,op-english,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.05,0:00:41.44,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}世人的眼光中我烈焰焚身
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.63,0:00:47.79,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}眼神中期盼著甜蜜殺戮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.02,0:00:54.34,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}現在我的心中燃起了一簇烈火
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.75,0:01:02.52,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}以我殘軀化烈火
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.85,0:01:31.58,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}這簇失控的火焰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.58,0:01:32.38,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}讓我把這座城市燒成灰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.38,0:01:33.23,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}燒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.23,0:01:34.05,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}燒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.05,0:01:35.44,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}燒成灰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.71,0:01:45.51,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}讓我把這座城市燒成灰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.51,0:01:46.36,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}燒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.36,0:01:47.18,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}燒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.18,0:01:48.57,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}燒成灰
Comment: 0,0:02:32.14,0:02:34.14,op-english,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.85,0:22:52.17,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}They will finally feel the flames
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.17,0:22:56.60,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Flames that run down through my veins
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.60,0:23:00.94,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}I will make the city burn
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.94,0:23:05.30,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}We're not planning to return
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.06,0:23:09.70,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Trying so hard to be free
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.12,0:23:13.52,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}To make you see what I see
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.89,0:23:18.43,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Hold on to your wishes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.43,0:23:22.25,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}If you can't hold on to me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.45,0:23:26.05,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Forgive me for letting you down
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.94,0:23:31.30,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Forgive me for letting you down again
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.30,0:23:34.50,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}I guess I'm not strong enough
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.12,0:23:38.34,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Right now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.16,0:23:45.70,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Oh my love
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.70,0:23:50.03,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}love
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.03,0:23:57.32,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}love
Comment: 0,0:23:57.88,0:23:59.88,op-english,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.85,0:22:52.17,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}他們終究會擦出愛情之火
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.17,0:22:56.60,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}火化為血液 在我體內流淌
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.60,0:23:00.94,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}我會引燃這座都市
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.94,0:23:05.30,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}我們從未有撤退的打算
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.06,0:23:09.70,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}努力去獲得自由
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.12,0:23:13.52,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}只為讓你見我所見
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.89,0:23:18.43,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}牢牢抓住你的期盼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.43,0:23:22.25,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}如果你無法再握住我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.45,0:23:26.05,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}請原諒我 讓你失望了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.94,0:23:31.30,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}請原諒我 又一次
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.30,0:23:34.50,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}我想還未擁有守護你的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.12,0:23:38.34,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}只為此時
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.16,0:23:45.70,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}哦 我的摯愛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.70,0:23:50.03,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}我們永恆的愛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.03,0:23:57.32,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}你我永不分離
Comment: 0,0:22:03.83,0:22:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,
